---
import BookingButton from './BookingButton.astro';
import TrustIcon from './TrustIcon.astro';
---
<section id="inicio" class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
 <picture class="hero-art"><source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/hero-watercolor-960.webp 960w, assets/hero-watercolor-1536.webp 1536w" sizes="100vw"/><img src="assets/hero-watercolor-1536.webp" alt="" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"/></picture>
 <div class="hero-copy"><svg class="hero-conversation" viewBox="0 0 64 52" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M36 23h12a9 9 0 0 1 9 9v5a9 9 0 0 1-9 9h-2l-7 4v-4h-3a9 9 0 0 1-9-9v-5a9 9 0 0 1 9-9Z" fill="#e5eadc" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 5h20a11 11 0 0 1 11 11v7a11 11 0 0 1-11 11H24l-10 6v-6A11 11 0 0 1 5 23v-7A11 11 0 0 1 16 5Z" fill="#fbf8f2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 17h19M16 23h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><p class="eyebrow">Psicoterapia en línea</p><h1 id="hero-title">Un espacio para<br class="desktop-break"/> comprenderte y<br class="desktop-break"/>  <em>encontrar dirección.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Acompañamiento cercano y herramientas<br class="desktop-break"/> basadas en evidencia para tu vida diaria.</p><div class="hero-actions"><BookingButton label="Agendar mi primera sesión"/><a class="button outline" href="#enfoque">Conoce nuestro enfoque</a></div><p class="soft-note">No necesitas tener todo claro para empezar.</p></div>
</section>
<div class="trust-strip" aria-label="Nuestra atención"><span><TrustIcon kind="evidence"/>Basada en evidencia</span><span><TrustIcon kind="personal"/>Atención personalizada</span><span><TrustIcon kind="online"/>100% en línea</span></div>
